message: "If you use LongPuzzleBench, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "LongPuzzleBench: Evaluating GUI Agents on Long-Horizon Visual Puzzles"
type: software
abstract: >-
  LongPuzzleBench is a benchmark of six deterministic browser puzzle games and
  114 levels for evaluating long-horizon visual reasoning and computer-use agents.
